<title>USA: Tyco to make further acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Tyco to make further acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyco International Inc Chief Executive Dennis Kozlowski said the company will use its free cash to make acquisitions to support its core divisions.</p>
<p>&quot;We'll probably be announcing small deals in the $50 million to $150 million range over the next few months that fit directly within our core businesses,&quot; Kozlowski told reporters and analysts during a conference call.</p>
<p>He said the company would soon announce two or three deals in Europe.</p>
</text>
